@startuml UML组件图
' 多人共享记账系统 —— 分层组件图
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
top to bottom direction

package "表现层" as PL {
  [记账客户端\n（Web / 小程序）] as UI
}

package "接入层" as GW {
  [API 网关\n会话校验 · 权限拦截 · 幂等键] as API
}

package "应用服务层" as SVC {
  [认证与权限服务] as Auth
  [账本与成员服务] as LedgerSvc
  [收支记录服务] as RecordSvc
  [审核与更正服务] as AuditSvc
  [统计与预算服务] as StatSvc
  [周期结算服务] as SettleSvc
  [操作日志服务] as LogSvc
}

package "数据层" as DATA {
  database "业务数据库\n账本 / 记录 / 结算" as DB
  database "操作日志库\n（只追加）" as LOGDB
}

UI --> API : HTTPS / JSON
API --> Auth : 校验会话
API --> SVC : 路由到业务服务
SVC --> DATA : 读写

LedgerSvc ..> RecordSvc : 校验成员权限
AuditSvc ..> RecordSvc : 更新记录状态
StatSvc ..> RecordSvc : 读取已审核记录
SettleSvc ..> RecordSvc : 汇总周期内记录

RecordSvc ..> LogSvc : 撤回 / 作废留痕
AuditSvc ..> LogSvc : 审核 / 越权留痕
SettleSvc ..> LogSvc : 结算结果 / 失败原因
LogSvc --> LOGDB

note right of SettleSvc
  结算是一个事务：
  任一环节失败即整体回滚，
  并写入失败日志
end note

@enduml
